{"title":"Career Roadmap · Level Designer","role":"Level Designer","summary":"A Level Designer designs the playable spaces and experiences within a game. The role combines game design, storytelling, player psychology, spatial thinking, pacing, scripting, and technical implementation to create levels that are fun, understandable, challenging, and aligned with the game's overall vision.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Animation & Game Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Years","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Game design fundamentals, spatial design, engines"}],[{"text":"Exploration"},{"text":"2027–2028"},{"text":"Level blockouts, scripting, game mechanics"}],[{"text":"Portfolio"},{"text":"2028–2029"},{"text":"Complete playable levels and game projects"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"2029–2030"},{"text":"Game Design Intern / Junior Level Designer"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Production-level level design"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Complex systems, narrative and multiplayer levels"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"2037–2040"},{"text":"Lead Level Designer / Lead Game Designer"}],[{"text":"Strategic"},{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Principal Designer / Game Director / Studio Leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Design & Game Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design fundamentals"},{"text":"Drawing and visual communication"},{"text":"Colour, composition and form"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"},{"text":"Game design principles"},{"text":"Game history and genres"},{"text":"Player psychology"},{"text":"Spatial design"},{"text":"Basic 3D modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical skills"},{"type":"p","text":"